  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "THE NIGHT WINDOW"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A fictional chamber performance"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "Original AI-generated concept illustration; imagined scenery, not a built set."
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeMeta",
      "text": "Saturday 14 November 2026 19:00–19:50 / The Imagined Room"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Three voices. One window. A light that keeps arriving after the street has gone dark."
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "Fictional programme example. This is not a real event listing or a ticket. All cast, venue and schedule…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A light stays on"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "What happens when one small room becomes a place to listen?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The Keeper tends a window no one remembers opening. The Listener arrives to ask for darkness. The…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Your reading route"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Meet the imagined company on page 3. Find the running order on page 4 and the artistic note on page 5.…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "This is original programme copy for a fictional concept, not a supplied performance script. No audience…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "The company"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "Three fictional voices; one shared room."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Creative roles"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Direction: Remy Lake. Visual concept: Jules Arden. Production coordination: Sora Finch. All are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The Keeper protects a routine. The Listener tests it. The Messenger makes a small change visible. These…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "Before real use, confirm names, roles, spellings, billing order and permission to publish each credit."
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Tonight’s order"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "A fictional 50-minute sequence, including a 10-minute interval."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "At a glance"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Planned end: 19:50. Performance sections total 40 minutes; the interval adds 10. These are invented…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Late admission, exit and re-entry arrangements must be confirmed with the actual organiser before…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "If a real schedule changes, update every start time, duration, total and interval reference together."
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "The window as a stage"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "A small opening makes a large choice visible."
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The cover imagines a freestanding window, warm light and a folded-paper bird. In the story, the window…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "A note on tone"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The imagined performance uses spoken dialogue and quiet pauses. No actual sound level, lighting cue,…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "The illustration supplies atmosphere. All event details remain editable native text."
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Before you attend"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "Access information must describe a real, checked venue."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Confirm with the organiser"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Ask about step-free arrival, entrances, seating choices, accessible toilets, hearing or captioning…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Publish a practical route"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "A real edition needs a current venue address, a working contact route, relevant booking instructions…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "This fictional programme supplies no live contact, booking link or accessible-route claim. The…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Credits and care"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "Be clear about what belongs to the example."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Original concept material"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Studio Templates supplied the fictional premise, programme text and editable layout. The cover is an…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Before a real production"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm the right to use any script, music, imagery and venue material you add. Verify credit wording…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "Status: fictional example only. No booking, licence, production approval, funding commitment or…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLabel",
      "text": "FICTIONAL PERFORMANCE / PROGRAMME"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Carry the question"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeLead",
      "text": "What would you keep in the light?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Take the question with you, or compare two readings of the window with someone else. There is no…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "For the next real edition"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Confirm the event, cast, running order, permissions and venue/access details. Replace every fictional…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "About this format"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Eight half-Letter pages in reading order. A booklet print export, if supplied, uses two landscape…"
    },
    {
      "style": "ProgrammeNote",
      "text": "All dates, people, venue and timings here are fictional. No tickets or reservations are available…"
    }
